[0m$ [0mgh issue comment "31" --repo "AgentsLoop/PlayGround" --body "## ✅ Orbit Orchard — verified complete on port 3000

**Summary:** The finished game is now served from the repo-root playable entrypoint \`./index.html\` (created identical to \`project/index.html\`; neither \`./index.html\` nor \`./dist/index.html\` existed before, so the entrypoint was repaired first and re-verified as the exact page the server delivers). Gameplay is unchanged: gardener astronaut orbits the planetoid collecting **8 glowing fruit in 60s**, keyboard + touch/drag controls, HUD (fruit count, timer bar, restart, mute), pickup particles/floaters/synth SFX, and win/timeout cards. No code fixes were needed — the served page passed every browser test on the first run.

**Links:**
- Playable entrypoint: \`index.html\` (also \`project/index.html\`) on branch \`opencode/34010499304\`
- Local preview: http://localhost:3000/ (tmux session \`app-server\`, \`python3 -m http.server 3000\`)
- Final commit: https://github.com/AgentsLoop/PlayGround/commit/3b0f9fa42a493b9e84dc1bdd135d95d05beabc60

**Deployment / test status:** Static file, no build step. Playwright + Chromium against http://127.0.0.1:3000/ — title correct, mid-play collection (3/8), full laps → win 8/8, forced timer expiry → lose, restart resets to 0/8 + play state, mobile-viewport touch-hold collects fruit; **zero console/page errors**. Screenshots below were captured from the port-3000 page and committed under \`screenshots/final-*.png\` (mirrored in \`project/screenshots/\`).

**Known limitations:** None.

